From: Alejandro <hello@knitfix.nl>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 00:20:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] long-lived payment links via /api/pay

Stripe checkout sessions expire after 24h, so quote and final payment
emails now link to /api/pay?ref=...&t=..., which reuses an open session
or creates a fresh one with the same amount and metadata. findSessionByRef
now prefers the paid session when several share a ref.

